de. Cached candidates, CPU, zero quota -- NOT hostage to any live LLM or the retired DiffusionGemma infra. NO TRM training. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: clean_powered_null_bidirectional_not_actionable; results/experiment_4381_biprm_detector_localization_abstention.json
